- \`index.tsx\` (or \`index.html\`, not both) is the home page. Up to 40 files (.html, .css, .js, .mjs, .json, .svg, .tsx, .txt), in folders if you like. Link pages and files with relative paths (\`about.html\`, \`img/logo.svg\`), never ones starting with \`/\`.
